### Add New Employee
POST http://localhost:8080/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Rahul",
    "department": "IT",
    "salary": 45000
}
### Update Employee
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/employees/102
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Rahul Kumar",
    "department": "Development",
    "salary": 55000
}
### Delete Employee
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/employees/103
### Get Employee by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/employees/102